			"description": "Fortsetzen / Pause on the black film strip.",
			"html": "<div class=\"ds-film\"><button class=\"ds-main\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 4.5v15l12-7.5z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>Fortsetzen</button><button class=\"ds-main\" disabled>Warte auf Spotify</button></div>",
			"css": ".ds-film{display:grid;gap:10px;padding:18px;background:#141210;font-family:'Hanken Grotesk Variable','Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-main{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:64px;padding:10px 16px;border:2px solid #f2ede6;border-radius:2px;background:#f2ede6;color:#141210;font:800 1.15rem/1.15 inherit;font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 180ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1),transform 180ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)}.ds-main:hover:not(:disabled){background:color-mix(in srgb,#f2ede6 88%,#141210)}.ds-main:active:not(:disabled){transform:scale(0.97)}.ds-main:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #f2ede6;outline-offset:3px}.ds-main:disabled{background:transparent;color:#f2ede6;border-style:dashed;font-size:0.98rem;cursor:default}"
		},
		{
			"name": "Main Transport Key (Linienplan)",
			"kind": "button",
			"refersTo": "transport-main-linie",
			"description": "Pill main key in the Sender's line colour on a white signage panel (shown: line red).",
			"html": "<button class=\"ds-main-linie\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 4.5v15l12-7.5z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>Fortsetzen</button>",
			"css": ".ds-main-linie{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;width:100%;min-height:64px;padding:10px 16px;border:2px solid #d6001c;border-radius:999px;background:#d6001c;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Atkinson Hyperlegible Next Variable','Atkinson Hyperlegible Next',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.15rem;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 180ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1),transform 180ms}.ds-main-linie:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,#d6001c 88%,#ffffff)}.ds-main-linie:active{transform:scale(0.97)}.ds-main-linie:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #0066b3;outline-offset:3px}"
		},
		{
			"name": "Round Play Key (Klassisch)",
			"kind": "button",
			"refersTo": "transport-main-klassik",
			"description": "76px round play key leading the centred transport row, with circular icon keys.",
			"html": "<div class=\"ds-k-row\"><button class=\"ds-k-play\" aria-label=\"Fortsetzen\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 4.5v15l12-7.5z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-k-icon\" aria-label=\"Weiter\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 5l10 7-10 7zM19 5v14\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-k-icon\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"Favorit\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20s-7-4.4-7-10a4 4 0 0 1 7-2.6A4 4 0 0 1 19 10c0 5.6-7 10-7 10z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></button></div>",
			"css": ".ds-k-row{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:18px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'SF Pro Text','Segoe UI',Roboto,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-k-play{display:grid;place-items:center;width:76px;height:76px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:#1d1d1f;color:#f5f5f7;cursor:pointer;transition:transform 180ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)}.ds-k-play:active{transform:scale(0.97)}.ds-k-play:focus-visible,.ds-k-icon:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #6a4cff;outline-offset:3px}.ds-k-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:52px;height:52px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;color:#1d1d1f;cursor:pointer}.ds-k-icon:hover{background:rgb(29 29 31 / 0.06)}.ds-k-icon[aria-pressed=true]{color:#ff375f}"
		},
		{
			"name": "Key",
			"kind": "button",
			"refersTo": "key-kontakt",
			"description": "Shared secondary key, Kontaktbogen paper values; hover fills with ink, pressed lit.",
			"html": "<div class=\"ds-keys\"><button class=\"ds-key\">Mix &amp; Regeln anpassen</button><button class=\"ds-key ds-key--quiet\">Neue Warteschlange</button><button class=\"ds-key ds-key--danger\">Löschen</button></div>",
			"css": ".ds-keys{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;font-family:'Hanken Grotesk Variable','Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-key{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:48px;padding:10px 18px;border:2px solid #141210;border-radius:2px;background:transparent;color:#141210;font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 180ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1),color 180ms,transform 180ms}.ds-key:hover{background:#141210;color:#eeedea}.ds-key:active{transform:scale(0.97)}.ds-key:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #d6331f;outline-offset:3px}.ds-key--quiet{border-color:#cfcbc5}.ds-key--danger{border-color:#b8261b;color:#b8261b}.ds-key--danger:hover{background:#b8261b;color:#eeedea}"
		},
		{
			"name": "Signal",
			"kind": "custom",
			"refersTo": "label",
			"description": "Requested / accepted / confirmed; waiting steps dashed, never solid until confirmed.",
			"html": "<ol class=\"ds-signal\"><li class=\"on\">Angefordert</li><li class=\"on wait\">Angenommen</li><li>Bestätigt</li></ol>",
			"css": ".ds-signal{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:6px;font-family:'Martian Mono Variable','Martian Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:0.66rem;letter-spacing:0.02em}.ds-signal li{padding-top:8px;border-top:3px solid rgb(20 18 16 / 0.22);color:#5c5853;font-weight:650;transition:border-color 180ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)}.ds-signal li.on{border-top-color:#ff4b2b;color:#141210}.ds-signal li.wait{border-top-style:dashed}"
		},
		{
			"name": "Progress (held vs confirmed)",
			"kind": "custom",
			"refersTo": "label",
			"description": "Confirmed progress solid in station ink; held or estimated as a 135° hatch.",
			"html": "<div class=\"ds-prog\"><div class=\"ds-bar\"><span style=\"width:52%\"></span></div><div class=\"ds-bar ds-held\"><span style=\"width:52%\"></span></div></div>",
			"css": ".ds-prog{display:grid;gap:12px}.ds-bar{height:6px;background:rgb(20 18 16 / 0.16);overflow:hidden}.ds-bar span{display:block;height:100%;background:#ff4b2b}.ds-held span{background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#ff4b2b 0 3px,transparent 3px 7px)}"
		},
		{
			"name": "Line Badge (Linienplan)",
			"kind": "chip",
			"refersTo": "line-badge-linie",
			"description": "Sender as transit line: S1, S2 …, A for Alles.",
			"html": "<div class=\"ds-badges\"><span class=\"ds-badge\" style=\"background:#0f1d33\">A</span><span class=\"ds-badge\" style=\"background:#d6001c\">S1</span><span class=\"ds-badge\" style=\"background:#2f8a1f\">S2</span><span class=\"ds-badge\" style=\"background:#f5c400;color:#0f1d33\">S3</span></div>",
			"css": ".ds-badges{display:flex;gap:8px}.ds-badge{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;min-width:46px;height:34px;padding:0 8px;border-radius:7px;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Atkinson Hyperlegible Next Variable','Atkinson Hyperlegible Next',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.1rem;letter-spacing:-0.01em;line-height:1}"
		},
		{
			"name": "Sender Card (Kontaktbogen)",
			"kind": "card",
			"refersTo": "station-card-kontakt",
			"description": "Black film card with station top edge; selected gets a 4px station outline.",
			"html": "<div class=\"ds-cards\"><div class=\"ds-card\" style=\"--st:#f2ede6\"><button><strong>Alles</strong><small>1056 Songs · Runde 1</small></button><a href=\"#\">Mix &amp; Regeln</a></div><div class=\"ds-card ds-sel\" style=\"--st:#ff4b2b\"><button><strong>Indie &amp; Gitarren</strong><small>400 Songs · Runde 1</small></button><a href=\"#\">Mix &amp; Regeln</a></div></div>",
			"css": ".ds-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;padding:8px;font-family:'Hanken Grotesk Variable','Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-card{display:grid;background:#141210;color:#f2ede6;border-top:6px solid var(--st);border-radius:3px}.ds-card button{display:grid;gap:6px;min-height:112px;padding:14px 14px 10px;border:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit}.ds-card button:hover{background:rgb(242 237 230 / 0.07)}.ds-card button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #f2ede6;outline-offset:-3px}.ds-card strong{font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:780;line-height:1.08}.ds-card small{font-family:'Martian Mono Variable','Martian Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:0.68rem;color:var(--st)}.ds-card a{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 14px;border-top:1px solid #3b3632;color:#f2ede6;font-weight:700;font-size:0.88rem;text-decoration:none}.ds-sel{outline:4px solid var(--st);outline-offset:4px}"
		},
		{
			"name": "Device Select",
			"kind": "input",
			"refersTo": "device-select",
			"description": "52px select with drawn chevron; 3px focus outline.",
			"html": "<select class=\"ds-select\"><option>Aktives Spotify-Gerät</option><option>Mikas iPhone</option></select>",
			"css": ".ds-select{width:100%;min-height:52px;padding:10px 44px 10px 14px;border:2px solid #141210;border-radius:2px;background-color:#f9f8f6;background-image:linear-gradient(45deg,transparent 50%,currentColor 50%),linear-gradient(135deg,currentColor 50%,transparent 50%);background-position:calc(100% - 22px) 52%,calc(100% - 16px) 52%;background-size:6px 6px;background-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;color:#141210;font-family:'Hanken Grotesk Variable','Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:1rem}.ds-select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #d6331f;outline-offset:3px}"
		},
		{
			"name": "Navigation",
			"kind": "nav",
			"refersTo": "label",
			"description": "Mark, lowercase wordmark, three nav links; current page carries a brand bar.",
			"html": "<header class=\"ds-head\"><a class=\"ds-brand\" href=\"#\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"5\" width=\"28\" height=\"22\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#141210\"/><rect x=\"5\" y=\"11.2\" width=\"22\" height=\"9.6\" fill=\"#eeedea\"/><path d=\"M6.6 12.6c4.6-.7 13.4-.9 19 .1.4 2.2.3 4.4-.2 6.6-5.6.6-13.6.6-18.6-.2-.5-2-.6-4.5-.2-6.3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e2362a\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>true-shuffle</a><nav><a href=\"#\" aria-current=\"page\">Hören</a><a href=\"#\">Verlauf</a><a href=\"#\">Menü</a></nav></header>",
			"css": ".ds-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;min-height:64px;border-bottom:2px solid #141210;background:#eeedea;color:#141210;font-family:'Hanken Grotesk Variable','Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-brand{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-height:44px;font-weight:800;font-size:1.35rem;letter-spacing:-0.035em;color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.ds-head nav{display:flex;gap:2px}.ds-head nav a{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 12px;color:#5c5853;font-weight:650;text-decoration:none;transition:color 180ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)}.ds-head nav a:hover,.ds-head nav a[aria-current]{color:#141210}.ds-head nav a[aria-current=page]{font-weight:750}.ds-head nav a::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:12px;right:12px;bottom:4px;height:3px;background:#e2362a;transform:scaleX(0);transition:transform 180ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)}.ds-head nav a[aria-current]::after{transform:scaleX(1)}.ds-head a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #d6331f;outline-offset:3px}"
		}
	],
	"narrative": {
		"northStar": "One Player, Four Papers",
		"overview": "**Creative North Star: \"One Player, Four Papers\"**\n\ntrue-shuffle is one standard listening shell (header with mark, lowercase wordmark and Hören / Verlauf / Menü; the stage with Sender, song, progress, signal and transport; the device select; *Als Nächstes* in stored order; the Sender grid; menu pages) that carries four complete visual worlds. The listener picks one under Menü › Gestaltung; the choice is a per-device convenience (localStorage `ts-design`, also `?design=<id>`) painted as the root attribute `data-design`, plus the matching favicon, touch icon and browser-bar colour. Nothing functional depends on it. Kontaktbogen is the default; Linienplan, Strichliste and Klassisch are full alternatives, not skins of it.\n\nEach world lends exactly four things: type, palette, density and one signature move. Layout, controls, tap targets and every honest-state distinction stay shared, so a song, a Sender and a command state read the same way whichever world is on. Day and night are fully drawn for every world: they follow `prefers-color-scheme` unless Menü pins `data-illumination=\"day\"` or `\"night\"` (localStorage `ts-illumination`). The brand guide in `docs/BRAND.md` owns name, voice, the slot table and icon pipeline; this file owns the visual system as built.\n\nThe screen is open for seconds while music runs for hours: song and Fortsetzen / Pause always come first, and nothing unconfirmed is ever printed like a fact.",
		"keyCharacteristics": [
			"One shell, four worlds: `kontakt` Kontaktbogen (default), `linie` Linienplan, `strich` Strichliste, `klassik` Klassisch.",
			"A single token vocabulary (`--bg --fg --fg-2 --hair --rule --raise --sunk --brand`, station `--st`/`--on-st`, radii `--r --r-lg --r-art --r-main`, line weights `--bw --rule-w`, key and stage tokens, six ink slots) that every world fills.",
			"Every Sender owns one of six ink slots and keeps that slot in every world.",
			"One signature per world: film strip with grease-pencil box; line badges and the queue as stops; five-bundle tally and marker underline; big centred cover with round play key.",
			"Requested, accepted and confirmed are three visibly different states; held and estimated never render solid.",
			"Display-scale song title, 52px+ transport keys, 44px minimum targets."
		],
		"rules": [
			{
				"name": "The Fixed Slot Rule",
				"body": "A Sender keeps the same ink slot in all four worlds (same ID, same slot); only the hue changes with the world. \"Alles\" never takes an ink slot; it takes the page ink.",
				"section": "colors"
			},
			{
				"name": "The One Brand Colour Rule",
				"body": "Each world has exactly one brand colour, used for the mark, the active navigation bar and the caret. Sender identity is carried by `--st`, never by `--brand`.",
				"section": "colors"
			},
			{
				"name": "The Edge Print Rule",
				"body": "Martian Mono exists only in Kontaktbogen, as edge print on and around the film: frame numbers, times, queue numbers, round and count lines, Sender-card meta and signal step labels. It never sets a title, a key label or body copy.",
				"section": "typography"
			},
			{
				"name": "The Utility Mono Rule",
				"body": "The system monospace stack (`ui-monospace, \"SF Mono\", Menlo, monospace`) is a utility fallback for code and diagnostic fields only (remote key input, `.code`, diagnostic data). It is not a type role and no world styles with it.",
				"section": "typography"
			},
			{
				"name": "The Lowercase Name Rule",
				"body": "The name is always \"true-shuffle\": lowercase, hyphenated, set in the active world's display face after its mark. Never capitalised, spaced, or abbreviated.",
				"section": "typography"
			},
			{
				"name": "The Material Depth Rule",
				"body": "A world earns a shadow only if its material casts one. Selection, focus and pressed states are shown with outlines, ink fills and inset rings, never with lift.",
				"section": "elevation"
			}
		],
		"dos": [
			"**Do** build every new surface in the shared shell and read only tokens (`--bg --fg --fg-2 --hair --rule --raise --sunk --brand --st --on-st --r --r-lg --r-art --r-main --bw --rule-w --key* --stage-* --ink-*`), then check it in all four worlds by day and by night.",
			"**Do** give a new world-specific detail to one world only, scoped under `[data-design=\"…\"]`, and keep it to type, palette, density or that world's existing signature.",
			"**Do** keep requested, accepted and confirmed visibly distinct, and render held or estimated values as hatch, dash or outline: never solid.",
			"**Do** print every fact a decorative signature draws (round share, queue position, song) as text beside it, and mark the drawing `aria-hidden`.",
			"**Do** floor counts and meters; never round up.",
			"**Do** keep transport keys at 52px or more and every target at 44px or more.",
			"**Do** write the name as \"true-shuffle\", lowercase, after the active world's mark."
		],
		"donts": [
			"**Don't** fill an unconfirmed state solid: no solid progress while held or estimated, no filled title while pending, no solid main key while unavailable.",
			"**Don't** let a world change layout, stage order, controls or copy; worlds differ in look only.",
			"**Don't** put a Sender's identity in `--brand` or move a Sender to a different ink slot in another world.",
			"**Don't** use Martian Mono outside Kontaktbogen, or the system monospace stack anywhere but code and diagnostic fields.",
			"**Don't** add shadows to Kontaktbogen or Strichliste beyond the shared sheet and toast; their depth is film and paper.",
			"**Don't** set labels in tracked capitals or add small labels above headings; section heads and labels stay sentence case.",
			"**Don't** write \"True Shuffle\", \"TRUE-SHUFFLE\", \"Trueshuffle\" or \"TS\" as the name."
		]
	}
}
